---
// About (关于) — the note card opened by the character.
// Pure markup + card styles; routing lives in the Overlays shell.
---
<div class="paper paper--card" id="about-view" data-open="false" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="paper__scrim" data-close></div>

  <div class="paper__stage paper__stage--card">
    <section
      class="paper__sheet"
      role="dialog"
      aria-modal="true"
      aria-labelledby="about-title"
    >
      <header class="paper__intro">
        <span class="paper__label">About</span>
        <h2 class="paper__title" id="about-title">关于</h2>
      </header>

      <div class="paper__body">
        <p class="paper__pair">
          <span class="paper__cn">你好！欢迎光临海兔的博客。</span>
          <span class="paper__en">Hi! Welcome to Maribbit's blog.</span>
        </p>
        <p class="paper__pair">
          <span class="paper__cn">这里是互联网上一个安静的角落。</span>
          <span class="paper__en">This is a quiet corner of the internet.</span>
        </p>
        <p class="paper__pair">
          <span class="paper__cn">没有针砭时弊、没有针锋相对，</span>
          <span class="paper__en">No critique of the times, no tit-for-tat,</span>
        </p>
        <p class="paper__pair">
          <span class="paper__cn">只是用我的梦和记忆构建的空间。</span>
          <span class="paper__en">just a space built from my dreams and memories.</span>
        </p>

        <footer class="paper__socials">
          <a
            href="https://github.com/Maribbit/blog"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener"
            aria-label="GitHub"
          >
